{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22797","headline":"卢侍御与崔评事爲予於黄鹤楼置宴宴罢同望 · 白居易","name":"卢侍御与崔评事爲予於黄鹤楼置宴宴罢同望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江边黄鹤古时楼，劳置华筵待我游。\n楚思淼茫云水冷，商声清脆管弦秋。\n白花浪溅头陀寺，红叶林笼鹦鹉洲。\n总是平生未行处，醉来堪赏醒堪愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}